## Task

Run `csdd plan status $ARGUMENTS` and summarize: which feats are done, in
progress, pending, or blocked; whether the plan is approved and drift-free; and
whether `log.md` holds unprocessed deviations (which route to the `prd` skill's
Revise workflow). State is derived from `specs/` reality — there is nothing to
edit here.
